    "sections": {
        "description": "A minimal photography blog theme that presents each post's images as a film-style contact sheet. The bundled Photo Strip block automatically collects every image in a post and lays them out as a horizontal scrolling strip of frames — like a photographer's proof sheet — each frame linking to the post. Includes light and dark style variations, comments, and post navigation. Live demo: https://contactsheetdemo.mebenedetto.com/"
